---
import { Fingerprint, ShieldAlert } from "@lucide/astro";
import snapshot from "../data/control-room-trajectory.json";
import Pipeline from "./Pipeline.astro";
import TrajectoryPlayer from "./TrajectoryPlayer.astro";
---

<section
  id="governed-runtime"
  class="section runtime-section"
  data-major-section
  data-section-name="Governed Runtime"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-heading heading-inline">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Governed Runtime · real trajectory</p>
        <h2>模型只提议；宿主重新鉴权、审批、落盘。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="runtime-boundary">
        <Fingerprint size={18} aria-hidden="true" />
        <span>
          <strong>{snapshot.provenance.mode}</strong>
          <small>{snapshot.provenance.run_id}</small>
        </span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <Pipeline />

    <div class="runtime-note">
      <ShieldAlert size={17} aria-hidden="true" />
      <p>同一条 runtime 展示授权审批与越权拒绝；页面不读取或展示 gold action。</p>
    </div>

    <TrajectoryPlayer />
  </div>
</section>
